Suggested adjustments to default ASA slicer print settings:
* Wall loops: 5 
* Top and bottom shell layers: 4
* Top and bottom shell thickness: 0.8mm
* Infill pattern: gyroid
* infill density: 15% 
* Initial layer speed: 35 mm/s
* Initial layer infill speed: 80 mm/s
* Support: Tree (organic)
* Skirt loops: 1
* Outer brim: 6mm
* All vent settings: off / vent speed 0% (exept for overhang cooling [on] with default settings)
